7. CHECK KEY EXISTS:
student = {"name":"Aahela","age":20,"mark":90}
key = input("Enter key: ")
if key in student:
    print("Key Exists")
else:
    print("Key Does Not Exist")


8. FIND MAXIMUM VALUE:
